# Fixed ep-cast positions for the perft parity suite.
#
# Every FEN here has an en-passant square AND a castable spell in hand, so
# the potion-gated en-passant captures of 15820b97 exist at depth 1. The
# random walk in gen_perft_suite.py does not reach them: only 0.38% of the
# positions it samples have ep active, and its sampled suite has none at all
# — the rule was only watched from depth 2, by accident.
#
# Sampled with gen_perft_suite.py's engine driver (seed 20260805, walk
# biased towards double pawn pushes), filtered on 'ep square set + own
# spell with cooldown 0', deduplicated. Their node counts are recorded by
# the external arbiter (Fairy-Stockfish PR #96), never by ourselves.
#
